Oh my God, I read this.

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:14.700
I read that. It's so funny.

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:16.700
Until the 1960s.

00:20:17.740 --> 00:20:19.160
And I think...

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:23.540
That has to be like some guy making a joke

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:24.740
and it just got through.

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:27.100
Like nobody, none of the editors caught it

00:20:27.980 --> 00:20:30.020
