00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:47.700
and like two-eyed frog monsters.

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:50.180
Or that the game is supposed to be like

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:52.860
based on a true story or something.

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:56.260
Right, right. Or that the haunted house is like

00:20:56.920 --> 00:20:59.760
definitively wild west or old west in their words, right?

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:01.260
Like I wouldn't say that.

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:04.500
I mean, I guess maybe a little bit like the house itself

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:06.360
